su name tools be map def
su name agent ob bool truth ya
su name command be command ob text input to name text answer can
su name session name ob text "command workflow" ya
prah

exists su name agent be mind via state "qwen3.5:9b" from discourse "Command only when needed. Answer in one brief sentence after success." ya
su name question ob text "Run exactly node --version with the command. After success, answer in one brief sentence confirming the Node version." for name agent with name tools be session do
